"1h4507cbh7k": "les directives et le marquage CE",
"1jqefji70o4": "T. B. Sheridan, <i>Telerobotics, Automation, and Human Supervisory Control</i>, MIT Press, 1992.",
"1hzkjgeber9": "G. Niemeyer, J.-J. E. Slotine, “Stable adaptive teleoperation”, <i>IEEE Journal of Oceanic Engineering</i>, 16(1), 1991 (wave variables).",
"1w1t443wpp5": "P. F. Hokayem, M. W. Spong, “Bilateral teleoperation: an historical survey”, <i>Automatica</i>, 42(12), 2006.",
